blocks.en:
• Pilot (100 meals drawn with a fixed seed; Haiku 5.5 and GPT-6.1 sol). Continue rule: for GPT-6.1
sol, the dual-photo bias closer to zero than the before-only bias by at least 5 points, and Spearman
correlation of predicted and true share eaten at least 0.3. Result: bias +12.3% → −1.9%, correlation 0.78;
rule met. The prompt was not changed, so the pilot meals are kept. • Deviation before the full run. After a literature check, we added the subtraction condition
(Section 4) as a secondary comparator. It was committed before any full-run call. • Added after a second review (exploratory, registered before the calls): conditions (3a) and (3b),
the repeated calls and the high-effort runs. • Added after the main results (exploratory): direct test of the leftover-group difference;
decomposition of the before-only error; model differences against Haiku 5.5; equivalence check of the day
mean; local recalibration; leftover definition details and share-eaten errors; results by meal;
Bland–Altman figure and the linear fit of day error on intake.

blocks.zh:
• 飞行员(用固定种子抽取100份;Haiku 5.5和GPT-6.1 sol)。 继续规则:用于GPT-6.1
索尔,双相偏差比前作偏差更接近于0,至少得5分,斯皮尔曼
预测和真实份额的关联性至少吃0.3分. 结果:偏差+12.3%--1.9%,相关性0.78;
规则满足。 提示没有改变,所以飞行员的餐食被保留. · 在全程前绕道。 经过文献检查,我们添加了减值条件
(第4节)作为二级参照国。 这是在全程通话前发生的 • 在第二次审查后增加(勘探,在通话前登记):条件(3a)和(3b),
重复的呼叫和高功率运行。 · 在主要结果(试验)后增加:直接测试剩余组别的差异;
唯一错误的分解; 模型差异与 Haiku 5.5; 当天的等同检查
平均; 局部再校正; 剩余定义细节和分享-食用错误; 以餐计结果;
Bland–Altman图和日入误差的线性相通.

